  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8405.02 Withdrawal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8405.02 Withdrawal.\n\n(a) If the director determines that the requirements set forth in Saf-C 8405.01 are satisfied, the director shall withdraw the person from the program.\n\n(b) Upon a sole contact person’s withdrawal, the participating person is removed from the program.\n\nSource. #14340, eff 8-14-25, EXPIRES: 8-14-35",
